Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:16.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}But the spread of energy changes shrinks\Nby a quarter: a faint echo of the spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:21.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}On a deliberately biased\Nmachine, it fails:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}one run diverged, the other got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:27.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}On the crossing rate, with one seed:
